# The screenshot review set. `python docs/shots.py docs/images` writes every
# screen in both themes as NN-name.png (plus light/), and copies the five the
# README and Docker Hub description reference to their plain names. Only those
# five are committed; the rest are there to look at before a release.
docs/images/[0-9]*.png
docs/images/light/
